    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just about the job. it's like everything i've built was based on being that \"perfect\" person. if i can't be that, then what's the point? i feel like i've already lost my place in their lives. it would be so much easier if they just remembered me as the person who actually succeeded, instead of having to watch me struggle and fail over and over.",
